# Scripts pinned by an integrity= hash in Mundialito/Views/Home/Index.cshtml must be deployed
# byte for byte. CI checks out on Windows, where git would otherwise convert their line endings
# to CRLF - which changes their hash, and browsers then refuse to run them.
# Tests/PinnedScriptIntegrityTests.cs fails the build if one is missed.
Mundialito/Client/lib/sentry/*.js -text
Mundialito/wwwroot/sentry/*.js -text
